io like it was it  felt sometimes performative for me like  i want to prove that i'm a good writer i  want to prove that i'm good and this  time for me was all about  you know scott here's like  where i'm at the worst part of like my  where my thoughts go  yeah um and i feel like that made  some of  that made like my favorite music that  i've made and also i feel like i they  really my collaborators became like my  brothers in the studio and  starting to be open with people like  with the collaborators and like in the  studio process  extended its way into my real life where  suddenly i was like oh i could be like  really anxious and still hang out with  my friend and just tell them about my  anxiety instead of being like let me  cancel because well because they're not  rolling in perfect either they probably  got their own baggage yeah and i felt  like in my mind maybe it's because i was  young i felt like everybody just did  have it more together than i did yeah i  think everyone goes through that we all  feel like yeah and then you grow up and  you're like everybody  everyone is screwed yeah we're all in  therapy yeah  [Music]
 

